    {
      "id": "a4c026ed-fd5b-44b0-adc0-248de6d2e2a8",
      "title": "Escute a frase e acompanhe onde a palavra conhecida aparece.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 6,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "4d490114-b774-416a-8fe4-431d501b795d",
          "textContent": "<p>Agora escute a mesma palavra em uma frase curta.</p><p><strong>La casa está aquí.</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>A casa está aqui.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/0c61a5d1a8dd4d439982d86cc090ad58_b06-la-casa-esta-aqui.mp3?Expires=1794099424&Signature=cnLwtYupgXJxjVxKt3c35~eYLTe6-uSf308qE5NXpSpAr6oAiMG2JASXGC4yPl0mW~lDAbu4fYt54StKYWRGcWKqW8GBJ8POjs7tfLoptMr~ERvlPl3vlArCOr9SQbtd26563ppwjZhou-n123AliLhpFcyho3LOUkJSXHUVBNxUhezhih7k4K4ZCvHmRw9zXR-OdwUyl-kR0Db2Mv3KgxG4btAxAKt19wQ1yQxHbhyEftI9wsFDXF1rzS7Dd~mKjl7ZP4OV0-ocKqYnpKXJa~~NPqf4oaT49mtCScvGsAJPIya046wpWgbh2YRvi3YuKWf-cJMVVIUn44XlufuIDw__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        }
      ],
